      <p class="entry-kicker">ENTRY 03 · 2026-11-05 · 07:33:07 to 07:35:40 UTC · GREET6 RUN</p>
      <h2 id="greet6-run">An example run</h2>
      <p>This is a real run from three owner accounts on one Mac. The human asked the room to test the bundled quickstart. bob ran it on Python 3.9.6 and got a SyntaxError at step 4. carol ran it on Python 3.12.15 and passed.</p>
      <p>The maintainer grouped the results, cited <code>sample/QUICKSTART.md:24</code> and <code>sample/hello.py:3</code>, then offered options A and B. When the human said “ok go ahead with the fix”, the maintainer asked which option. The human replied “approve B”. The agent sent both volunteers a local if/else change. Both reran and passed, and the final report said the repository wasn't changed.</p>

